WEBVTT

00:00.200 --> 00:05.600
MOTHER / MOTHER
机器人，快来帮我！把煎饼翻个面——马上要糊了！快点！
Robot, come help me! Flip the pancake—it’s about to burn! Hurry!

00:05.000 --> 00:10.100
YOUNGER SISTER / YOUNGER SISTER
机器人！我摔倒了！真的好疼！请帮帮我！
Robot! I fell! It really hurts! Please help me!

00:10.200 --> 00:15.050
MOTHER / MOTHER
快点，要糊了！先把它翻过来！
Hurry, it’s burning! Just flip it over first!
